1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,480
If you mow a lot, you know the mower seat isn't great.

2
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:09,000
Mine is cracked and uncomfortable.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Your backside gets soaked when it rains, and it hurts after twenty minutes.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:23,760
But this seat cover solves all that, with a built-in cooler pocket for your beer and a tool pocket at the back.

5
00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:27,320
For me it was a no-brainer, and I don't regret it.

6
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:33,200
Right now they're on sale, and it's cheaper than when I bought mine.

7
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:35,880
So hurry, before the sale ends.
